# Cloudflare static-asset headers for the whole site (`add-web-app`,
# `add-site-shell`: home, /play/, /theme/ and, later, /wiki/). File names aren't
# hashed, so caches revalidate after an hour; a deploy is seen within it.
/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600, must-revalidate
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
